      "writtenOn": "2017-11-03T15:41:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How is it saved if neither -p or -j is specified, and the FILENAME does not end in one of these? What if they conflict? Which takes priority? (Looks like the filename.) Do we need both ways to specify the option?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 65,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 65,
        "endChar": 81
      },
      "revId": "a4d44415c905be192c0e62d0e86a7163abb170c5",
